  "prefLabel": "Cmp 102.02 Open Meetings and Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cmp 102.02 Open Meetings and Quorum. The following shall apply to commission meetings:\n\n(a) The commission shall meet at least 6 times a year;\n\n(b) Each commission meeting shall be open to the public in accordance with RSA 91-A;\n\n(c) Notice of each meeting shall be posted at the planetarium office and the State House at least 7 days prior to the meeting, except that rulemaking hearings shall also meet the additional notice requirements of RSA 541-A:6; and\n\n(d) A quorum of the commission shall be 8 members.\n\nSource. #7368, eff 9-27-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cmp100-300.html"
}
